   "html": "O quadrado tem 5 fileiras com 5 quadradinhos em cada uma: 5 × 5 = <span class=\"pw\">5<sup>2</sup></span> (lê-se “cinco ao quadrado”).<div class=\"row\"><svg class=\"ill\" width=\"98\" height=\"98\" viewBox=\"0 0 98 98\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"22\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"58\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"76\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"22\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"22\" y=\"22\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"22\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"58\" y=\"22\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"76\" y=\"22\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"40\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"22\" y=\"40\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"40\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"58\" y=\"40\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"76\" y=\"40\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"58\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"22\" y=\"58\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c9a5ee\" stroke=