   "n": 7,
   "html": "Calcule as potências:<div class=\"grid\"><div><span class=\"pw\">2<sup>3</sup></span> = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"8\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:64px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div><span class=\"pw\">3<sup>2</sup></span> = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"9\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:64px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div><span class=\"pw\">10<sup>3</sup></span> = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"1000\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:64px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div><span class=\"pw\">4<sup>2</sup></span> = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"16\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:64px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div><span class=\"pw\">2<sup>5</sup></span> = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"32\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:64px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div><span class=\"pw\">7<sup>2</sup></span> = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"49\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:64px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div></div>",
