  {
   "n": 8,
   "html": "Resolva as expressões numéricas:<div class=\"ql\"><div>a) 20 − 3 × 4 + 2 = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"10\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:60px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div>b) (8 + 4) × 5 − 10 = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"50\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:60px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div>c) <span class=\"pw\">3<sup>2</sup></span> + 4 × (10 − 6) = <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"25\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:60px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div></div>",
   "gab": "a) 10 · b) 50 · c) 25"
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "html": "Uma escola recebeu <b>24 caixas</b> com <b>36 livros</b> em cada uma. Os livros serão divididos igualmente entre <b>8 turmas</b>. Quantos livros cada turma receberá?<div class=\"row\"><svg class=\"ill\" width=\"120\" height=\"102\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 102\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"44\" width=\"52\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#d9a066\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"28\" y=\"44\" width=\"8\" height=\"36\" fill=\"#f3d9b5\"/><rect x=\"62\" y=\"44\" width=\"52\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#d9a066\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"84\" y=\"44\" width=\"8\" height=\"36\" fill=\"#f3d9b5\"/><rect x=\"34\" y=\"8\" width=\"52\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#d9a066\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"56\" y=\"8\" width=\"8\" height=\"36\" fill=\"#f3d9b5\"/><text x=\"60.0\" y=\"96.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">24 caixas</text><text x=\"60.0\" y=\"31.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#5a3b12\">36 livros</text></svg><input class=\"in\" data-a=\"108\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:70px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> livros</div>",
   "gab": "24 × 36 = 864 · 864 ÷ 8 = 108 livros"
  },
